    "note": "Mirror of the Figma local variables. Edit here, run `npm run tokens`, then sync to Figma.",
    "architecture": "Tier 1 Primitives (raw values; only space, radius and border-width are bound directly) → Tier 2 Color (semantic roles, mode Light) and Dimension (focus, sizes) → Layout (responsive roles) and Typography (content scale + UI roles) → Component (one-off decisions of a single component). Every non-primitive token aliases a primitive directly (one hop). See DESIGN.md §5 and D-030.",
